<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Seawolf #2, Duckshoot, 1996</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;NEWS&lt;SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;“The President has just announced a blockage of all Cuban ports, US ships are saide to be heading for &lt;?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Cuba&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt; as I speak, but no details have been released about the composition of the blockading forces. The Soviet task force is still headed toward &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Cuba&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;, so a confrontation appears to be imminent.”&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;“ Military sources have confirmed earlier reports that the Russian armed forces are now fully mobilized and moving into forward positions. This movement is occurring both in Europe and along the Russian Confederacy’s border with &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;China&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;. The Chinese army is also in a state of&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;war-readiness, with troops moving into position along the Russian and Vietnamese borders. “&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;“ We will keep you apprised of any late-breaking developments in this story. Now over to Jerry for sports…”&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;BACKGROUND&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB" lang=EN-GB&gt;US subs and vessels have been ordered to blockade all Cuban ports and patrol entire Cuban coastline. The goal is to cut supplies and arms from reaching pro-Castro forces on the &lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Island&lt;/st1:place&gt;. The Seawolf is to patrol a wide section of the northern Cuban coast. All non-US vessels in this area, are either pro-Castrol naval ships or merchant ships that have ignore our repeated warnings. The Seawolf is free to fire, but only after having clearly identified the target as a non-US naval vessel.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
